# ERNIE 5.5 Flash — findings by Nemotron 3 Ultra 550B A55B

- Source: Baidu (`baidu/ernie-5.5-flash`)
- Date: 2026-11-11 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** ERNIE 5.5 Flash
- **Short description:** Baidu's 280B/14B sparse MoE model pre-trained on 33.5T tokens with HCA and MLA-DSA attention, delivering 1M context at >200 tok/s for high-volume coding and text.
- **Provider / access:** Baidu Qianfan (`ernie-5.5-flash`), Baidu Cloud API. Standard and off-peak promotional pricing tiers.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release date not publicly specified; pre-trained on 33.5T tokens; knowledge cutoff not publicly specified.
- **IDs:** `baidu/ernie-5.5-flash` (Baidu Qianfan); no free ID on OpenCode Zen or OpenRouter.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 total / 131,072 max output (per meta.json)
- **Modalities:** Text in; text out; reasoning; tool calls
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** Standard: ~¥2/¥8 per 1M (input/output) ≈ $0.28/$1.13 per 1M; Off-peak promotional: ~¥1/¥4 per 1M ≈ $0.14/$0.56 per 1M. No free tier on OpenCode Zen or OpenRouter.
- **Architecture:** 280B total / 14B active sparse MoE with HCA and MLA-DSA attention; proprietary.

